name: AWS boto3 Integration Generator
description: Generate production-ready boto3 AWS integration code
---
Write a Python AWS integration using boto3 for:

{input}

Requirements:
- Authentication via AWS_PROFILE environment variable only
- Retry logic with exponential backoff for all API calls
- Python logging module (no print statements)
- Complete Google-style docstrings on all functions
- Proper exception handling with specific AWS error types (ClientError, BotoCoreError)
- Never hardcode credentials, keys, region, or bucket names
- Load all config from environment variables or .env file
- Include a .env.example snippet showing required variables

Structure the code so each function does one thing only.
